// Шлейф картин в рамах за курсором на первом экране (параметры Cursor Image Trail с enzoo.framer.website: шаг ~115px, появление 1s, исчезание через 0,5s)
(()=>{const hero=document.querySelector('.hero');if(!hero||!matchMedia('(hover: hover) and (pointer: fine)').matches||matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches)return;const sources=Array.from({length:10},(_,i)=>`assets/trail/${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}.jpg`),images=sources.map(src=>{const img=new Image();img.src=src;return img}),layer=document.createElement('span');layer.className='hero-trail';layer.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');hero.prepend(layer);let index=0,last=null;hero.addEventListener('mousemove',event=>{const rect=hero.getBoundingClientRect(),x=event.clientX-rect.left,y=event.clientY-rect.top;if(last&&Math.hypot(x-last.x,y-last.y)<115)return;const source=images[index];index=(index+1)%images.length;if(!source.complete||!source.naturalWidth)return;last={x,y};const img=source.cloneNode(),height=parseFloat(getComputedStyle(layer).getPropertyValue('--trail-h'))||(innerWidth<=1100?200:240),width=height*source.naturalWidth/source.naturalHeight;img.alt='';img.style.left=`${x-width/2}px`;img.style.top=`${y-height/2}px`;layer.append(img);const grow=img.animate([{transform:'scale(0)'},{transform:'scale(1)'}],{duration:1000,easing:'cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)',fill:'forwards'});setTimeout(()=>{const current=getComputedStyle(img).transform;grow.cancel();img.animate([{transform:current},{transform:'scale(0)'}],{duration:450,easing:'cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)',fill:'forwards'}).finished.then(()=>img.remove(),()=>img.remove())},500)});hero.addEventListener('mouseleave',()=>{last=null})})();
